@startuml fr11-goals-values
' Origin: drafted with AI assistance (Claude Code) from FR-11 in docs/02-requirements.md; reviewed by the author.
title FR-11 Personal goals and value statements
|Student|
start
split
  :POST /goals {title, why, optional targetDate};
  |Planner|
  if (title 1–100, why 1–500,\ntargetDate not before today (Sydney)?) then (no)
    :400;
    stop
  else (yes)
    :Create Goal; 201;
  endif
  |Student|
  :POST /goals/{id}/achieve;
  |Planner|
  if (goal is the student's?) then (no)
    :404;
    stop
  elseif (already achieved?) then (yes)
    :409;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Record achievedAt;
  endif
split again
  |Student|
  :POST /values {text};
  |Planner|
  if (text 1–280 characters?) then (no)
    :400;
    stop
  else (yes)
    :Create ValueStatement; 201;
  endif
end split
|Student|
:GET /goals, GET /values, DELETE /goals/{id}, DELETE /values/{id};
|Planner|
:Not-achieved goals and values are\nquoted in reminders (FR-12);
stop
@enduml
